            <componentInstance>
                <componentInstanceProperties>
                    <name>componentsJson</name>
                    <value>[{&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Highlights panel with quick actions (Assign Volunteers, Find Volunteers, Send Survey Invitation)&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: &quot;Proves the coordinator can act directly from the record - matching volunteers to open slots and triggering post-event feedback surveys without leaving the page.&quot;}, {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Status path / Path Assistant&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: &quot;Shows the initiative moving through its lifecycle stages (e.g. planning to published to complete) so the team has a shared, visual definition of where the effort stands.&quot;}, {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Performance field section (Total Volunteer Hours, Filled vs Open vs Total Assignments, Active Volunteer Count, Attendance Rate)&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: &quot;Real-time staffing and impact KPIs on the record itself - the coordinator sees coverage gaps and attendance at a glance and can report volunteer hours for impact and grant reporting.&quot;}, {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Open and Closed Assignments related lists with inline actions (Mark Absent, Mark Complete)&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: &quot;Lets the coordinator run day-of operations and attendance tracking inline - filtered so live assignments and finished ones are separated automatically.&quot;}, {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Job Positions related list&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: &quot;Defines the roles and shifts that need staffing under this initiative, so demand is modeled before volunteers are matched to it.&quot;}, {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Project Checklist (Action Plan) and Record Tags / Interest Tags&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: &quot;Standardizes the operational steps to launch an initiative and tags it by interest area so volunteers can be matched on skills and passions, not just availability.&quot;}]</value>
                </componentInstanceProperties>
                <componentInstanceProperties>
                    <name>customItemsJson</name>
                    <value>{&quot;Quick Actions&quot;: [&quot;Mark Absent&quot;, &quot;Mark Complete&quot;]}</value>
                </componentInstanceProperties>
                <componentInstanceProperties>
                    <name>orientation</name>
                    <value>This is the home base for a single volunteer initiative or campaign - the event or program effort that volunteers sign up to staff, with its job positions, shifts, and individual assignments rolling up underneath it.</value>
                </componentInstanceProperties>
                <componentInstanceProperties>
                    <name>pageTitle</name>
                    <value>Volunteer Initiative Record Page</value>
                </componentInstanceProperties>
                <componentInstanceProperties>
                    <name>persona</name>
                    <value>Volunteer Coordinator (or Volunteer Program Manager) running staffing for an initiative</value>
                </componentInstanceProperties>
                <componentInstanceProperties>
                    <name>platformTieIn</name>
                    <value>Because the volunteers staffing this initiative are the same constituent records as your donors, program participants, and case clients, volunteer engagement isn&apos;t a siloed app - it&apos;s one more dimension of the 360-degree person view. The hours and attendance captured here feed the same outcome and impact reporting your fundraising and grant teams rely on, all on one Nonprofit Cloud platform.</value>
                </componentInstanceProperties>
                <componentInstanceProperties>
                    <name>soundbite</name>
                    <value>Every open shift, every no-show, and every hour served lives on one record - so you fill gaps before the event, not explain them after.</value>
