                <componentInstanceProperties>
                    <name>valueStory</name>
                    <value>Coordinators usually live in spreadsheets to track who signed up, who showed up, and how many open slots remain - which breaks down the moment an initiative scales. This page gives them one operational record where capacity, attendance, and hours update live, with one-click actions to assign or recruit volunteers so they can fill gaps before the event instead of after.</value>
